OL,3,GNEWSADemolition for century-old
OL,4,Aweightlifting club site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to knock down the home of Bethnal
OL,7,FGreen Weightlifting Club have been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FThe east London club, which is based at
OL,11,Fthe council-owned Professional
OL,12,FDevelopment Centre, is under threat
OL,13,Fbecause of a plan to rebuild the site
OL,14,Fand replace it with a library and 44
OL,15,Fhomes, including 24 for social rent.
OL,16,FThe proposals were voted through by
OL,17,FTower Hamlets councillors on 5
OL,18,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
