OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADemolition for century-old
OL,4,Aweightlifting club site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the club, which has
OL,7,Fbeen at its gym in Turin Street and
OL,8,FBethnal Green Road since 1948, can stay
OL,9,Funtil June 2027 and will not have to
OL,10,Fmove until a suitable new location is
OL,11,Ffound.
OL,13,FBut weightlifting club members warned
OL,14,Fthat, without a long-term solution,
OL,15,Frelocation "would quietly end" it.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
